{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18707","headline":"行路难三首 二 · 柳宗元","name":"行路难三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虞衡斤斧罗千山，工命采斫杙与椽。\n深林土剪十取一，百牛连鞅摧双辕。\n万围千寻妨道路，东西蹶倒山火焚。\n遗余毫末不见保，躏跞磵壑何当存。\n羣材未成质已夭，突兀哮豁空岩峦。\n柏梁天灾武库火，匠石狼顾相愁冤。\n君不见南山栋梁益稀少，爱材养育谁复论。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18707.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18707","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}